<title>UK: SLM Student Loan Trust to launch $2.5 bln bond.</title>
<headline>SLM Student Loan Trust to launch $2.5 bln bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>SLM Student Loan Trust 1997-2 will issue a $2.496450 three-tranche global, asset-backed bond tomorrow, lead manager Bear Stearns announced on Monday.</p>
<p>Tranche A1 will be for $1.601 billion and will mature January 25, 2002. Tranche A2 will be for $808 million with a April 25, 2002 maturity. Both tranches will be rated AAA by Moody's and S&amp;P. Tranche A3 will be for $87.45 million and will mature April 25, 2000. --London newsroom,  +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
